#: memory.cpp:101
msgid ""
"This display shows you the current memory usage of your system. The values "
"are updated on a regular basis and give you an overview of the physical and "
"virtual memory being used."
msgstr ""
"Esta pantalla amuésate l'usu actual de memoria del to sistema. Los valores "
"anuévense davezu y dante una vista previa de la memoria física y virtual que "
"ta usándose."

